---
description: Frontend UI/UX and Component Standards
globs: "**/*.{tsx,jsx,vue,svelte,html}"
---
- Always follow a cohesive design system (typography, spacing scale, color palette).
- Use modern component primitives (e.g., Radix UI, shadcn/ui, Tailwind).
- Ensure WCAG AA accessibility: minimum 4.5:1 text contrast and interactive focus states.
- Implement mobile-first layouts with smooth transitions (150-200ms ease-out).
- Never hardcode arbitrary colors; use theme variables or design tokens.